/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  Reaction set MillerBowman1989_AppA: the whole of Appendix A (235 reactions of the C/H/O/N mechanism, 51 species).
  Miller & Bowman 1989; the hydrogen-oxygen reactions of Appendix A are also the
  OConaire2004 set's (a second source of the same equations).  Its members are the
  records whose `sets {}` names it.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType  kineticsSet;
citation    "Miller and Bowman, Prog. Energy Combust. Sci. 15 (1989) 287-338";
doi         "10.1016/0360-1285(89)90017-8";
thermochemistry
{
    citation "not printed in the appendices (the CHEMKIN thermodynamic data base of the period); the run reads the NASA TP-2002-211556 table";
}
